# Temporary HP48gII ARMToolbox48 Port-0 install probe.
2000 tap f6
4000 tap f6
7000 capture home
# Configure wire I/O to Serial.
8000 tap files
9500 tap down
10000 tap enter
11500 tap down
12000 tap down
12500 tap down
13000 tap down
14000 tap enter
16000 tap up
17000 tap f2
18000 tap down
18500 tap enter
20000 tap enter
# Start Kermit server.
22000 tap files
23500 tap down
24000 tap enter
25000 tap down
25500 tap down
26000 tap down
26500 tap down
27000 tap down
28000 tap enter
30000 capture server-serial
# Host sends L275 and FINISHes at ~31s.
39000 capture after-transfer
# Recall L275 from VAR and install library 275 into Port 0.
40000 tap var
41000 capture vars
42000 tap f1
43000 capture l275-stack
44000 tap zero
45000 capture port-zero-stack
46000 tap sto
48000 capture stored
# Warmstart attaches the installed library.
50000 chord on f3
55000 capture after-warmstart
59000 finish-install
